identified ShiRide native library. resources/remote-rsa-shiride-*.pem contain
public protocol keys extracted from the identified application samples.
These compatibility resources are accompanied by source fingerprints and are
not user credentials or private keys. This repository does not claim ownership
of, or grant a new license to, the original third-party application, native
library, embedded third-party material, trademarks or vehicle firmware.

No APK, native SO, private signing key, real account token, real MCUID, vehicle
location or personal vehicle record is included. ShiRide, Zontes and other
product names identify the analyzed products; no affiliation is implied.

resources/remote-159.json contains static interoperability parameters recovered
from the identified official Android 1.59 sample. It contains no account token,
real device identifier or BlueShield security image.
